on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 44 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] eq ...................................... <soundBusy(1) = 1>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 23] ............................ if soundBusy(1) = 1 then
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 28 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 16] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 18] sub ..................................... <the frame - 2>
  [ 19] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame - 2>
  [ 21] extcall 29 .............................. go(the frame - 2)
  [ 23] ret
end
